      "seed": 1262450542,
      "version": 222,
      "versionNonce": 2131755310,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1787238081913,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "we dont need p1 array since we only need two variables hence we can save space\n\n\nT = 0\nfor i in range(1, len(b)+1):\n    curr = max(prev + b[i],b[i], 0)\n    prev = curr\n    # one based indexing\n    T = max(T,curr)",
      "fontSize": 61,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "we dont need p1 array since we only need two variables hence we can save space\n\n\nT = 0\nfor i in range(1, len(b)+1):\n    curr = max(prev + b[i],b[i], 0)\n    prev = curr\n    # one based indexing\n    T = max(T,curr)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
